 <description>WCH CH32V002D4U6 RISC-V MCU, QFN12 2x2 mm / 0.4 mm pitch, 2.5-5 V, 12-bit ADC, 11 I/O. The exposed pad is VSS (the QFN12 has no separate VSS pin) - route it to ground.</description>
